+## 2026-09-18 — Kernel-local alternatives checkpoint resumed
+
+Base main was freshly read as `93ee7f253b00c470a56b27091bb278764700c98f`,
+tree `6e6c53b476592e88abdaeb84887bb0018bb3cc65`; its successful GitHub Actions
+artifact 10518349029 reconstructed that tree exactly in a new workspace. PR #42 is
+merged, no PR is open, and the existing durable branch
+`automation/source-alternatives-checkpoint-20260918` was resumed rather than racing
+or duplicating it.
+
+Problem addressed: Boolean-plus-placeholder Option/Result records force local
+`None`/error values to invent data for the unselected branch. The checkpoint adds
+source-only eliminator-encoded Either/Maybe helpers, two registered examples and an
+executable driver. This run reconciled the theory with the discovered rank-1 limit:
+dynamic choices share one elimination result type, and the abstraction is not a
+first-class storable sum. No parser form, compiler primitive, guest allocation,
+ABI layout or resource limit changes; core audit remains 33 compiler primitives
+plus four source-prelude callables. Böhm/Berarducci 1985 is cited as prior art; no
+novelty or timing claim.
+
+Fresh completed checks: alternatives 8/8; expanded corpus 108/108; docs 26/26;
+host, reducers, case studies, standard example build and alternatives driver passed;
+core, prelude and operator audits passed. Chromium 144 passed 2,622 core checks plus
+276 experiment checks / 138 experiment cases. HTTP navigation was attempted and
+policy-blocked with `net::ERR_BLOCKED_BY_ADMINISTRATOR`. Scalar examples emit 510
+and 555 byte modules with ASABI 1, zero loops, zero intermediate guest bytes and no
+guest memory; exact compiler-work counts are retained in
+`docs/ALTERNATIVES-VALIDATION.md`.
+
+Publication remains blocked. Exact unsuffixed `npm test` attempts of 900 seconds and
+1,500 seconds both reached passing subtest 1407 with no `not ok` line but never
+reached the final TAP summary before harness termination. Per repository policy this
+is not a pass, so main was not changed. The durable alternatives checkpoint branch
+is the handoff; the next pass should finish that exact validation before considering
+any main fast-forward or a separate native tagged-sum design.
